person melee game, which is set among the Warhammer Fantasy Battles universe. The heroes face an alliance of a Chaos army and the Skaven horde. You choose from five characters, each with three branching careers to master, and work through missions while climbing difficulty tiers that start at Recruit.\n\nCombat is bloody, close-quarters melee, and teamwork matters because the party survives or falls together. It can be played solo or with up to three friends online. It suits fans of intense co-op action against hordes who like building a character through RPG-style progression."}}